  killer but once you dig a little bit  deeper you'll start to see how many  downsides it has compared to the pro  which i'll mention in just a minute but  the biggest downside of the air  is that while it gets the a14 chip with  killer graphics performance  you can't use it to the full potential  because the air  does not have 120 hertz promotion tech  because of that the gaming performance  is similar to the cheaper ipads which is  a bit disappointing  and on top of that it only comes with 64  gigs of storage  compared to 128 on the pro so if you  want more  you have to go straight to 256 gigs  which brings the price up to 750 dollars  basically right in ipad pro territory so  honestly  there are only a few reasons why anybody  should buy the new air  the first reason is if you want that new  redesign instead of buying the cheaper  ipads  which will start to look outdated very  soon the second reason is if you want  that a14  chip that's gonna have software support  for many more years  the third reason is if you have a hard  limit  of six hundred dollars to spend on an  ipad  so you can't justify going for the pro  and finally  the air is a great choice if you really  just want  the magic keyboard case since you can  get it for a total of nine hundred  dollars with the air  instead of eleven hundred dollars with  the pro and now  finally let's get into who should be  buying the ipad  pro if you want the best and most  premium tablet  ever made this is the one to get and if  you take gaming  seriously then this ipad is the one to  buy because it's the only one  with a 120hz display and it's got  basically the same graphics power as the  air  but on top of that it has the highest  multi-core cpu performance  and it comes with six gigs of ram  compared to four on the air  and three on the cheaper ipads it's also  got by far  the best speakers and microphone quality  the bezels are thinner than on the air  and the usb-c  port is twice as fast the display also  gets brighter  than any other ipad it's basically the  best of the best  and it comes with 128 gigs of storage  which is actually a solid amount that  most people will be completely fine with  even gamers and on top of that the 11  inch model is now on sale  for 750 bucks on amazon which is a  killer deal for what you get  and don't forget that there's also the  larger 12.9 inch model  if you really want to replace your  laptop however  the final thing to consider is that we  should be seeing a new ipad pro  with the a14x chip within half a year  and i believe that the performance on  that ipad pro  is gonna be mind-blowing so keep that in  mind as well  so there you guys go there are all of  the differences between these ipads  and if this video helps you make a  decision feel free to use the links down  below to help this channel out  and if it didn't help you go ahead and  comment down below and i'm gonna reach  out and comment  and help you decide which one to buy and  definitely check out our full ipad  air versus ipad pro comparison video  right over  there thank you guys for watching and  we'll see you in the next one

